{"id":"a891b0f45131631a","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-modular-form.md","title":"Modular Form","display":"df-modular-form — Modular Form","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-modular-form","aliases":["58-df-modular-form","58-df-modular-forms","Modular Form","Modular Forms"],"display":"df-modular-form — Modular Form","depends_on":["[[58-df-modular-group]]","[[58-df-holomorphic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-modular-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-modular-form</span><span>58-df-modular-forms</span><span>Modular Form</span><span>Modular Forms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modular-form — Modular Form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dbeb6e7ed5730d0f\" href=\"?note=dbeb6e7ed5730d0f\" title=\"58-df-modular-group\">58-df-modular-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e27b623be13cf38\" href=\"?note=2e27b623be13cf38\" title=\"58-df-holomorphic\">58-df-holomorphic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{H}\">\\(\\mathcal{H}\\)</span> (upper half-plane)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f: \\mathcal{H} \\to \\mathbb{C}\">\\(f: \\mathcal{H} \\to \\mathbb{C}\\)</span> (complex-valued function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k \\in \\mathbb{Z}\">\\(k \\in \\mathbb{Z}\\)</span> (weight)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma \\subseteq SL_2(\\mathbb{Z})\">\\(\\Gamma \\subseteq SL_2(\\mathbb{Z})\\)</span> (congruence subgroup)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma=\\begin{pmatrix} a &amp; b \\\\ c &amp; d \\end{pmatrix}\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\gamma=\\begin{pmatrix} a &amp; b \\\\ c &amp; d \\end{pmatrix}\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> (matrix element)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\">\\(C\\subseteq\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\)</span> (cusp-orbit representatives), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)^C\">\\(\\sigma\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)^C\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^C\">\\(h\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^C\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S\\)</span> (holomorphic)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModularForm}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ModularForm}_S\\)</span> (modular-form predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SlashAction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SlashAction}_S\\)</span> (slash-action predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CuspForm}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CuspForm}_S\\)</span> (defined here; cusp form)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolomorphicAtCusps}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HolomorphicAtCusps}_S\\)</span> (holomorphy-at-cusps predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S\\)</span> (Fourier-expansion predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}form\\text{-}slash} \\vdash \\mathrm{SlashAction}_S(g,f,k,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow f,g\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal H}\\land k\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\gamma=\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;b\\\\c&amp;d\\end{pmatrix}\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\bigl(g(z)=(cz+d)^{-k}f(\\gamma z)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}form\\text{-}slash} \\vdash \\mathrm{SlashAction}_S(g,f,k,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow f,g\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal H}\\land k\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\gamma=\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;b\\\\c&amp;d\\end{pmatrix}\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\bigl(g(z)=(cz+d)^{-k}f(\\gamma z)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}form\\text{-}cusp\\text{-}expansion} \\vdash \\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S(a,f,k,c,\\sigma,h)\\leftrightarrow a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\land\\sigma\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)\\land h\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\sigma(\\infty)=c\\land\\exists g\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SlashAction}_S(g,f,k,\\sigma)\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\bigl(g(z)=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}a(n)e^{2\\pi i n z/h}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}form\\text{-}cusp\\text{-}expansion} \\vdash \\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S(a,f,k,c,\\sigma,h)\\leftrightarrow a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\land\\sigma\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)\\land h\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\sigma(\\infty)=c\\land\\exists g\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SlashAction}_S(g,f,k,\\sigma)\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\bigl(g(z)=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}a(n)e^{2\\pi i n z/h}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}form\\text{-}cusps}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HolomorphicAtCusps}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists C\\subseteq\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)^C\\;\\exists h\\in(\\mathbb N_{&gt;0})^C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\;\\exists!c\\in C\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\gamma r=c)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{26mm}\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\;\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S(a,f,k,c,\\sigma(c),h(c))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}form\\text{-}cusps}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HolomorphicAtCusps}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists C\\subseteq\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)^C\\;\\exists h\\in(\\mathbb N_{&gt;0})^C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\;\\exists!c\\in C\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\gamma r=c)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{26mm}\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\;\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S(a,f,k,c,\\sigma(c),h(c))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}form} \\vdash \\mathrm{ModularForm}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow \\Gamma\\leq SL_2(\\mathbb Z)\\land k\\in\\mathbb Z\\land f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal H}\\land\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S(f,\\mathcal H)\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;\\mathrm{SlashAction}_S(f,f,k,\\gamma)\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicAtCusps}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}form} \\vdash \\mathrm{ModularForm}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow \\Gamma\\leq SL_2(\\mathbb Z)\\land k\\in\\mathbb Z\\land f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal H}\\land\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S(f,\\mathcal H)\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;\\mathrm{SlashAction}_S(f,f,k,\\gamma)\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicAtCusps}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}form\\text{-}cusp\\text{-}form}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CuspForm}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ModularForm}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\n\\land\\exists C\\subseteq\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)^C\\;\\exists h\\in(\\mathbb N_{&gt;0})^C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\;\\exists!c\\in C\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\gamma r=c)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S(a,f,k,c,\\sigma(c),h(c))\\land a(0)=0\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}form\\text{-}cusp\\text{-}form}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CuspForm}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ModularForm}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\n\\land\\exists C\\subseteq\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)^C\\;\\exists h\\in(\\mathbb N_{&gt;0})^C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\;\\exists!c\\in C\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\gamma r=c)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S(a,f,k,c,\\sigma(c),h(c))\\land a(0)=0\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The definition no longer assumes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in M_k(\\Gamma)\">\\(f\\in M_k(\\Gamma)\\)</span>, which was circular, and replaces vague growth by holomorphy at every cusp.</li>\n<li>Cusp representatives, scaling matrices, widths, and coefficient sequences are all quantified inside the definition; no unbound cusp-set or constant-coefficient primitive remains.</li>\n<li>The dimension formula for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_k(SL_2(\\mathbb Z))\">\\(M_k(SL_2(\\mathbb Z))\\)</span> is a downstream theorem and has been removed.</li>\n<li>Weight <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\tau+1) = f(\\tau), f(-1/\\tau) = \\tau^k f(\\tau)\">\\(f(\\tau+1) = f(\\tau), f(-1/\\tau) = \\tau^k f(\\tau)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Eisenstein: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_k(\\tau) = \\sum_{(c,d)=1} (cz+d)^{-k}\">\\(E_k(\\tau) = \\sum_{(c,d)=1} (cz+d)^{-k}\\)</span>, orthogonal to cusp forms</li>\n<li>Hecke: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n\">\\(T_n\\)</span> act on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_k(\\Gamma)\">\\(M_k(\\Gamma)\\)</span>, eigenvalues are Hecke eigenvalues</li>\n<li><code>58-df-modular-forms</code> is merged here; it stated the same modular-form transformation condition.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Diamond and Shurman, A First Course in Modular Forms</li>\n<li>Iwaniec, Quantum Modular Forms</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-modular-group","status":"resolved","id":"dbeb6e7ed5730d0f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-modular-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-holomorphic","status":"resolved","id":"2e27b623be13cf38","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-holomorphic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{H}","display":false},{"tex":"f: \\mathcal{H} \\to \\mathbb{C}","display":false},{"tex":"k \\in \\mathbb{Z}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma \\subseteq SL_2(\\mathbb{Z})","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma=\\begin{pmatrix} a & b \\\\ c & d \\end{pmatrix}\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)^C","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}^C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModularForm}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SlashAction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CuspForm}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HolomorphicAtCusps}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}form\\text{-}slash} \\vdash \\mathrm{SlashAction}_S(g,f,k,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow f,g\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal H}\\land k\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\gamma=\\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\\\c&d\\end{pmatrix}\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\bigl(g(z)=(cz+d)^{-k}f(\\gamma z)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}form\\text{-}cusp\\text{-}expansion} \\vdash \\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S(a,f,k,c,\\sigma,h)\\leftrightarrow a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\land\\sigma\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)\\land h\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\land\\sigma(\\infty)=c\\land\\exists g\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SlashAction}_S(g,f,k,\\sigma)\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\bigl(g(z)=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}a(n)e^{2\\pi i n z/h}\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}form\\text{-}cusps}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{HolomorphicAtCusps}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\exists C\\subseteq\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)^C\\;\\exists h\\in(\\mathbb N_{>0})^C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\;\\exists!c\\in C\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\gamma r=c)\\\\\n&\\hspace{26mm}\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\;\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S(a,f,k,c,\\sigma(c),h(c))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}form} \\vdash \\mathrm{ModularForm}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow \\Gamma\\leq SL_2(\\mathbb Z)\\land k\\in\\mathbb Z\\land f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal H}\\land\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S(f,\\mathcal H)\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;\\mathrm{SlashAction}_S(f,f,k,\\gamma)\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicAtCusps}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular\\text{-}form\\text{-}cusp\\text{-}form}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{CuspForm}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{ModularForm}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\n\\land\\exists C\\subseteq\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in SL_2(\\mathbb R)^C\\;\\exists h\\in(\\mathbb N_{>0})^C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P^1(\\mathbb Q)\\;\\exists!c\\in C\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\gamma r=c)\\\\\n&\\hspace{20mm}\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S(a,f,k,c,\\sigma(c),h(c))\\land a(0)=0\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in M_k(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"M_k(SL_2(\\mathbb Z))","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\tau+1) = f(\\tau), f(-1/\\tau) = \\tau^k f(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"E_k(\\tau) = \\sum_{(c,d)=1} (cz+d)^{-k}","display":false},{"tex":"T_n","display":false},{"tex":"M_k(\\Gamma)","display":false}],"bytes":4018,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca5920196b4108bd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1e44a603d4403766","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ModularForm}_S$ (modular-form predicate, see [[58-df-modular-form]])"},{"id":"39648aefc44f4243","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6364723ca702a8e6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8d50da078de7aa54","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-modular-form]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-854","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-modular-form.md|58-df-modular-form]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["dbeb6e7ed5730d0f","2e27b623be13cf38"]}